{"id":"n89375-1-8","stage":5,"title":"효력 · 效力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89375-1-8-1","ko":"왜 약을 먹었는데도 통증이 멈추지 않죠?","zh":"为什么吃了药，疼痛还是没有停止呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었는데도","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었는데도","audio":"/audio/d0966030c0525a34a627.mp3"}},{"text":"통증이","meaning":"疼痛","explanation":"통증：疼痛；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"통증","audio":"/audio/42baff33ccfc121915c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49309","senseId":"1","lemma":"통증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통증이","audio":"/audio/d3ace7487474548afb0b.mp3"}},{"text":"멈추지","meaning":"停，止","explanation":"멈추다：停，止；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"2","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈추지","audio":"/audio/3941782877f2532d6ac2.mp3"}},{"text":"않죠?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않죠","audio":"/audio/695cbd9de3beb1b45654.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"42baff33ccfc1219","term":"통증","zh":"疼痛","audio":"/audio/42baff33ccfc121915c2.mp3","entryId":"49309","definition":"疼的症状。","pronunciation":["통ː쯩"]},{"id":"eaee887b30c38d73","term":"멈추다","zh":"停，止","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3","entryId":"46133","definition":"动作或状态不再持续。","pronunciation":["멈추다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d41d99f32745bef8c046.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89375-1-8-2","ko":"세 시간은 지나야 효력이 나타나니 조금 더 참으세요.","zh":"药效需要三小时左右才会显现，再忍耐一会儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"시간은","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간은","audio":"/audio/e1d688e7e3d590dec4fd.mp3"}},{"text":"지나야","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나야","audio":"/audio/8feba2891f617d48b2d2.mp3"}},{"text":"효력이","meaning":"效力，效用，效果，功效","explanation":"효력：效力，效用，效果，功效；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"효력","audio":"/audio/46d8d6583f3906b03139.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89375","senseId":"1","lemma":"효력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"효력이","audio":"/audio/2db6e1210a504386568a.mp3"}},{"text":"나타나니","meaning":"显示，展现","explanation":"나타나다：显示，展现；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"2","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나타나니","audio":"/audio/d3dc142345780565d431.mp3"}},{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"참으세요.","meaning":"忍住，忍受，忍住","explanation":"참다：忍住，忍受，忍住；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"참다","audio":"/audio/1cfaf7914b38f877c7e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29772","senseId":"1","lemma":"참다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참으세요","audio":"/audio/6f96cb2f97856db3a4b0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"三","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"17194","definition":"三个的。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"